WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.734
Plan and Schedules can be switched, for every Popkin at once.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.065
Features shows each one, how far it reaches and since when: Plan on in every live

00:00:13.065 --> 00:00:15.804
Popkin, Schedules in three chosen ones.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.695
An Owner chooses Off. The dialog says what happens: the tab disappears within a

00:00:24.695 --> 00:00:26.837
minute, and nothing is deleted.

00:00:27.037 --> 00:00:29.117
A reason goes to the audit log.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.989
Schedules is off: hidden in every Popkin, with who did it and when.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.423
Everyone turns it on for all of them, again with a reason.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.247
Or keep it to chosen Popkins. Add one by searching the live Popkins, and remove one

00:00:57.247 --> 00:00:58.495
with its cross.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.713
A Support admin sees every switch, switched off: only Owners can do this.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.599
On a phone the panels stack. On a desktop, the sidebar sits beside them.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.941
What the tests prove: when a change fails, nothing changes and the reason is kept to

00:01:26.941 --> 00:01:27.829
try again.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.916
That is journey twenty-three. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
